ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniIntro::
    .string "So. You have reached the\n"
    .string "VIRIDIAN GYM at last.\p"
    .string "You have defeated seven LEADERS\n"
    .string "to stand here. Strength alone could\l"
    .string "not have carried you that far.\p"
    .string "Every battle is a contest of\n"
    .string "information.\p"
    .string "What does your opponent want?\n"
    .string "What do they fear?\l"
    .string "Which choice appears safest to them?\p"
    .string "Understand those things, and you no\n"
    .string "longer need to control every\l"
    .string "possibility. You need only control\l"
    .string "the possibilities that matter.\p"
    .string "A careless TRAINER waits for the\n"
    .string "opponent to act and then responds.\p"
    .string "A capable TRAINER prepares for the\n"
    .string "response before the first move is\l"
    .string "made.\p"
    .string "Show me which kind of TRAINER you\n"
    .string "have become.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniDefeat::
    .string "…Excellent.\p"
    .string "I tried to narrow your choices, and\n"
    .string "you refused to become predictable.\p"
    .string "When I prepared for your response,\n"
    .string "you changed the question.\p"
    .string "You did not merely overpower my\n"
    .string "POKéMON. You understood the battle.\p"
    .string "There is nothing more I require from\n"
    .string "a challenger to this GYM.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniPostBattle::
    .string "You have already proven yourself\n"
    .string "here.\p"
    .string "There is little value in repeating\n"
    .string "a lesson once it has been\l"
    .string "understood.\p"
    .string "Go to the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
    .string "There you will face TRAINERS who\n"
    .string "will not simply test whether you\l"
    .string "are strong.\p"
    .string "They will test whether you\n"
    .string "understand why you are winning.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_DominionBadgeTakeThis::
    .string "You have earned the DOMINION BADGE.\n"
    .string "{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\p"
    .string "Eight BADGES now belong to you.\p"
    .string "The POKéMON LEAGUE can no longer\n"
    .string "deny you entry. What happens from\l"
    .string "this point forward will depend\l"
    .string "entirely upon what you do with the\l"
    .string "strength you have earned.\p"
    .string "Take this as well.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM54FromGiovanni::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM54\n"
    .string "from GIOVANNI.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM54::
    .string "TM54 contains PSYCHIC.\p"
    .string "Its value is not merely its power.\p"
    .string "A strong attack delivered at the\n"
    .string "expected moment can be answered.\l"
    .string "The same attack delivered when your\l"
    .string "opponent has already committed to\l"
    .string "the wrong response can decide the\l"
    .string "battle.\p"
    .string "Remember that.\p"
    .string "Prediction without action is useless.\n"
    .string "Power without thought is wasteful.\p"
    .string "Use both.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YouDoNotHaveSpace::
    .string "You do not have space for this!\p"
    .string "Return when you can receive TM54.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiIntro::
    .string "Every battle begins with\n"
    .string "possibilities.\p"
    .string "Let's see how many of yours I can\n"
    .string "take away.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiDefeat::
    .string "You kept creating new options!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiPostBattle::
    .string "Control isn't about having every\n"
    .string "choice. It's about preserving the\l"
    .string "choices that actually matter.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiIntro::
    .string "I'll take the advantage and hold it!\n"
    .string "If you want control back, you'll\l"
    .string "have to earn it!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiDefeat::
    .string "You broke my rhythm completely!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiPostBattle::
    .string "GIOVANNI doesn't expect a perfect\n"
    .string "plan. He expects you to recognize\l"
    .string "the moment when the plan must\l"
    .string "change.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonIntro::
    .string "Powerful POKéMON are dangerous in\n"
    .string "anyone's hands. What matters is\l"
    .string "whether the TRAINER knows exactly\l"
    .string "what to ask of them.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonDefeat::
    .string "Your POKéMON never hesitated!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonPostBattle::
    .string "A command given at the right moment\n"
    .string "is worth more than ten given too\l"
    .string "late.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoIntro::
    .string "Once I put you under pressure, I\n"
    .string "won't let up! Find your opening\l"
    .string "before I close it!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoDefeat::
    .string "You knew exactly when to strike!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoPostBattle::
    .string "Pressure makes people predictable.\n"
    .string "GIOVANNI uses that better than\l"
    .string "anyone.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenIntro::
    .string "I don't need to know every move you\n"
    .string "could make. I only need to know the\l"
    .string "ones you're most likely to choose.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenDefeat::
    .string "You made the obvious answer the\n"
    .string "wrong one!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenPostBattle::
    .string "That's GIOVANNI's lesson. Once your\n"
    .string "opponent thinks they understand the\l"
    .string "battle, change what the battle is\l"
    .string "asking of them.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiIntro::
    .string "GIOVANNI is ahead. Don't enter that\n"
    .string "battle waiting to see what he does.\l"
    .string "Make him answer you!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiDefeat::
    .string "That's it! You took the initiative!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiPostBattle::
    .string "You're ready. If GIOVANNI controls\n"
    .string "the pace, you'll spend the whole\l"
    .string "fight trying to catch him.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeIntro::
    .string "You've made it to the final GYM.\n"
    .string "That means brute strength stopped\l"
    .string "being enough a long time ago.\p"
    .string "Show me you can think ahead!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeDefeat::
    .string "You were already ready for my\n"
    .string "answer!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColePostBattle::
    .string "GIOVANNI watches what a TRAINER does\n"
    .string "before the obvious move. Anyone can\l"
    .string "react after the danger appears.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelIntro::
    .string "A good TRAINER chooses a move.\n"
    .string "A great TRAINER knows what that move\l"
    .string "will make the opponent do next.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelDefeat::
    .string "You kept steering me where you\n"
    .string "wanted!$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelPostBattle::
    .string "If you can predict the response, you\n"
    .string "can prepare the answer before the\l"
    .string "question is even asked.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiFirstApproach::
    .string "Last GYM.\p"
    .string "GIOVANNI trains DRAGON POKéMON.\p"
    .string "The spinner tiles are simple once\n"
    .string "you stop rushing them. Look where\l"
    .string "the arrow points and where you'll\l"
    .string "land before you step on one.\p"
    .string "ICE and DRAGON attacks are the\n"
    .string "basic weaknesses of Dragon.\p"
    .string "But don't expect GIOVANNI to give\n"
    .string "you a clean target just because you\l"
    .string "brought the right move.\p"
    .string "Strong POKéMON are dangerous.\n"
    .string "Strong POKéMON that control when\l"
    .string "you get to act are worse.\p"
    .string "I've got a DRATINI with me.\n"
    .string "Want one last practice battle?$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiAccept::
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "Don't just look for the weakness.\n"
    .string "Watch who controls the pace.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiBattleDefeatEmpty::
    .string "$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiWin::
    .string "That's it.\p"
    .string "ICE and DRAGON can hit Dragon hard.\p"
    .string "But you saw what THUNDER WAVE and\n"
    .string "AGILITY can do.\p"
    .string "Knowing the right attack doesn't\n"
    .string "help much if the battle stops\l"
    .string "happening on your terms.\p"
    .string "GIOVANNI will try to make your\n"
    .string "choices predictable. Don't let him.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiLoss::
    .string "You know what hurts Dragon.\p"
    .string "That wasn't the problem.\p"
    .string "Pay attention to when you were\n"
    .string "allowed to attack, and when DRATINI\l"
    .string "made you react instead.\p"
    .string "Think about that, then try again.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryOffer::
    .string "One last practice round?$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryYes::
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "This time, take control before\n"
    .string "DRATINI does.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryNo::
    .string "Fair enough.\p"
    .string "GIOVANNI's waiting.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiDecline::
    .string "All right.\p"
    .string "Then remember the short version:\p"
    .string "ICE. DRAGON.\p"
    .string "Watch the spinner arrows.\p"
    .string "And don't let GIOVANNI decide every\n"
    .string "exchange.\p"
    .string "The rest is yours.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRepeatHint::
    .string "You really want the short version?\p"
    .string "ICE. DRAGON.\p"
    .string "Follow the spinner arrows.\p"
    .string "Control the pace.\p"
    .string "You know the rest.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiPostBadgePracticed::
    .string "That's eight.\p"
    .string "When we met in PEWTER, I was giving\n"
    .string "you answers.\p"
    .string "By the time you reached GIOVANNI,\n"
    .string "you were finding your own.\p"
    .string "That's all I was trying to teach you.\p"
    .string "The POKéMON LEAGUE is next.\n"
    .string "I think you're ready.\p"
    .string "Good luck.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiPostBadgeSkipped::
    .string "Eight BADGES.\p"
    .string "And you didn't need my last\n"
    .string "practice battle.\p"
    .string "That's probably the best answer\n"
    .string "you could've given me.\p"
    .string "You know how to read a battle for\n"
    .string "yourself now.\p"
    .string "The LEAGUE is next. Go show them.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchOffer::
    .string "Back for another practice round?\p"
    .string "I've brought a stronger team.\n"
    .string "Want to see how far you've come?$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchDecline::
    .string "Fair enough.\n"
    .string "I'll be right here.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchStart::
    .string "Good.\n"
    .string "Show me what you can do.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchDefeat::
    .string "That's the answer I wanted to see.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchAfter::
    .string "You've come a long way.\n"
    .string "Keep trusting what you see.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: GIOVANNI\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: GIOVANNI\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

